**MakeProjects.in** is a dedicated platform built for B.Tech and M.Tech students to discover, learn, and build industry-ready projects. The platform curates a wide range of IEEE paper-backed and general domain projects that align with the latest technology trends.

> **Note to Recruiters & Hiring Managers:** I developed and built this complete platform from scratch as a freelance developer based on a client's specific requirements. It serves as a showcase of my ability to deliver end-to-end frontend solutions, responsive design, and dynamic interactions **without relying on heavy frameworks**, demonstrating my strong grasp of web fundamentals.

